SELECTION CRITERIA:
To identify published and unpublished qualitative research with children aged 3 months to 18 years with chronic 
non‐cancer pain and their families focusing on their perceptions, experiences and views of chronic pain, services and 
treatments. The final inclusion criteria were agreed with a patient and public involvement group of children and young 
people with chronic non‐cancer pain and their families.

INSTRUCTIONS: For each study below, decide INCLUDE or EXCLUDE.
