│ child-friendly, easy and providing a clear guide for the daily school situation. Themes as: daily obligation,        │
│ unwillingness of the child, lack of motivation or time of the parents or teachers and insufficient instruction       │
│ illustrated experienced barriers for the use of the booklet. Effectiveness: Identified themes: 1) Children express   │
